text.en:
Add the three explicit branches before the fallback, each mapping a state to the next one.
```vhdl
when "00"   => nxt <= "01";
when "01"   => nxt <= "10";
when "10"   => nxt <= "00";
when others => nxt <= "00";
```

text.es:
Añade las tres ramas explícitas antes del comodín, cada una llevando un estado al siguiente.
```vhdl
when "00"   => nxt <= "01";
when "01"   => nxt <= "10";
when "10"   => nxt <= "00";
when others => nxt <= "00";
```
